            {
              "text": "Hiring data shows 27 open roles with Sales: 11, R&D: 8, Marketing: 3 (published 2026-09-02).",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-088"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "What it means for us: active hiring in Sales and R&D is a clear go-to-market and product-scale signal to prioritize outreach to those functions.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-088"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "",
          "contactRefs": [],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "ABM program \"being built from scratch\" — Senior Manager, ABM & Integrated Campaigns (posted 2026-06-17)",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "A public job posting describes the ABM program state as \"being built from scratch\" and requests ownership of 1:1, 1:few and 1:many programs (published 2026-06-17).",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-090"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "What it means for us: the ABM Senior Manager role reports to Vari Kaur, Head of Growth Marketing, making Vari a likely internal champion for ABM conversations.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-090",
                "zaf-024"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "",
          "contactRefs": [
            {
              "name": "Vari Kaur"
            }
          ],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Standing up partner/alliances channel — Director of Alliances req posted 2026-09-01",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "A Director of Alliances posting describes a move to build a partner ecosystem \"from scratch\" and asks the hire to own alliances strategy anchored in GSIs and extending into cloud and ISV partners (published 2026-09-01).",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-091"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "What it means for us: the company is prioritizing partner motions and may be receptive to partner enablement or co-sell conversations tied to alliances.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-091"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "",
          "contactRefs": [],
          "priority": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
