      "items": [
        {
          "h2": "Series C $60M (Dec 2, 2025) — reported total funding $130M",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran announced a Series C of $60M led by Menlo Ventures on Dec 2, 2025 and reported total funding of $130M.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-125",
                "zaf-124"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "What it means for us: recent large financing and the reported total funding support messaging around ongoing product and global expansion investments.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-125",
                "zaf-124"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "",
          "contactRefs": [],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Estimated annual revenue $10M–$25M (estimate as of 2026-08-22)",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Estimated annual revenue is between 10,000,000 and 25,000,000 USD (estimate as of 2026-08-22).",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-015"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "What it means for us: the revenue band '10m_50m' and this estimate provide a target-sizing anchor for pricing and deal-fit conversations.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-016",
                "zaf-015"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "",
          "contactRefs": [],
          "priority": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "tools",
      "empty": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "h2": "Uses HubSpot and Salesforce; SDR stack includes Sales Navigator, ZoomInfo, Outreach (observed 2026-09-02)",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "The GTM stack lists marketing_stack entries including HubSpot and Salesforce and an SDR stack with Salesforce, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, ZoomInfo and Outreach.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-089"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "What it means for us: HubSpot/Salesforce presence aligns with our integration points and the explicit absence of ABM vendors in the posting highlights a messaging entry point around ABM enablement.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-089"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "",
          "contactRefs": [],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Agentic AI / Exposure Graph; integrates with scanners and routes as a single ticket to Jira or ServiceNow",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Company describes 'Agentic Exposure Management', an Exposure Graph, and integrations with scanners, endpoint agents, cloud security tools and ticketing through Jira or ServiceNow.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-147"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "What it means for us: stated integrations with scanners and ticketing increase technical fit for remediation-focused workflows and playbooks.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-147"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "",
          "contactRefs": [],
          "priority": 2
        }
      ]
