            {
              "text": "Product is described as the \"core platform plus two add-ons\" named Zafran Discover and Zafran Autonomous Workflows.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-173"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "What it means for us: company claims include de-risking 90% of critical vulnerabilities overnight and an \"87%\" RemOps time reduction, framing remediation-led value propositions we can echo.",
